   "@id": "https://www.digitalgrowthsociety.org/#term-ai-agents",
   "name": "AI agents",
   "description": "An AI agent is an artificial intelligence program that can make decisions, pursue goals, and take actions independent of humans. Agentic AI contrasts with tool-like AI use for narrow, specific tasks such as answering questions - as with chatbots in the non-agentic forms that were common in 2023, or with traditional machine learning algorithms.",
